I look at the bottom of the screen.
There are some official instructions there.
I read those instructions once again.
'If you do not receive the message, upon request an alternative code is sent via email.'
I often choose the email option for such tasks.
I tap on that button.
Then I open my email app on the phone.
I wait for the new email.
Fortunately, that message arrives there instantly.
I open that new email.
There is a new code in it.
I copy that code.
I go back to the portal's page.
I type that code in the empty box.
I press the 'Submit' button again.
A green checkmark immediately appears on the screen.
Now a new message is displayed there.
'Your profile has been successfully updated.'
I heave a sigh of relief.
Finally, this work of mine is complete.
